OL,3,GNEWSAPenpals reunited 56 years after
OL,4,Aexchange trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree women have enjoyed a "very
OL,7,Femotional" reunion with their German
OL,8,Fpenpals, 56 years after taking part in
OL,9,Fa foreign exchange programme.
OL,11,FThe former pupils at King Edward VI
OL,12,FAcademy, in Spilsby, Lincolnshire, met
OL,13,Ffellow students from Maxdorf, Germany,
OL,14,Fin 1970.
OL,16,FNearly six decades on, Claire Fort, Pat
OL,17,FLill and Rosemarie Oliver, welcomed
OL,18,FHeike Utta, Monica Weber and Birgit
OL,19,FOstertag back to Britain.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
