OL,3,GNEWSAPenpals reunited 56 years after
OL,4,Aexchange trip
OL,5,
OL,6,FFort said: "I pulled up at the hotel in
OL,7,FSkegness where they were staying and we
OL,8,Fjust threw our arms around each other
OL,9,Fand it was lovely."
